# Three customers reach one shredder together.  The middle customer first
# queues for the occupied front square, then feeds from the side when the
# machine clears.  Finishing must discard that obsolete front-square intent
# so the final customer can push past rather than wait forever.
name Finished Intent
dim 6 5
ent wall 0 2
ent wall 1 2
ent wall 2 2
ent wall 3 2
ent wall 0 3
ent wall 0 4
ent wall 1 4
ent wall 2 4
ent wall 3 4
ent wall 4 4
ent wall 5 4
ent cube 4 2 3
ent cube 3 3 2
ent cube 1 3 1
ent worker 4 2
ent worker 3 3
ent worker 1 3
ent shredder 4 3
goal shredded 3
